      "instance_name": "propaganda_oration",
      "label": "Hitler delivering a propagandistic speech",
      "description": "Adolf_Hitler is depicted in a well-known propagandistic pose, raising his right fist while standing in front of a microphone, suggesting he is addressing an audience. The scene is framed to emphasize his authoritative and intimidating presence, typical of Nazi-era rallies. The overlaid text adds a fictional and hateful narrative to the image, but the visual composition itself remains that of a public oration.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
